# the quiver's lift only: the fletching in the aim (off|on, steps 0-2, stills) and the reloads (steps 0 and 2)
cheat god
set time 16 0
view clean
overlay off
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
face 90
wait 500
manual on
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
equip ITAR_Leather_L
arrows player 40
insert BAU_904_BAUER
wait 300
immortal BAU_904_BAUER on
pin BAU_904_BAUER 1200 0 0
aimat BAU_904_BAUER body
tap bow
cam look 110
wait 1500

stats str 30 dex 10 bow 10 talent 0
quiver lift off
press action
wait 900
rec fl_t0_off novideo
wait 600
cam follow 110 105 -90
wait 100
shot t0_off_side
wait 100
cam follow 110 105 -45
wait 100
shot t0_off_fr
wait 100
cam follow 110 105 -160
wait 100
shot t0_off_back
wait 100
stop
quiver lift on
wait 600
rec fl_t0_on novideo
wait 600
cam follow 110 105 -90
wait 100
shot t0_on_side
wait 100
cam follow 110 105 -45
wait 100
shot t0_on_fr
wait 100
cam follow 110 105 -160
wait 100
shot t0_on_back
wait 100
stop
release action
wait 1200

